oads/2026/09/03_12772378896a966d2787d01.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/02_13452186266a966d2442e44.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 愛回家之三代同糖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/02_13452186266a966d2442e44.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/10_8818054296a966d40b580c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 愛回家之三代同糖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/10_8818054296a966d40b580c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/6156711499016117671_8295671366a2f5f1fbe143.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 愛回家之三代同糖 （圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/6156711499016117671_8295671366a2f5f1fbe143.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/6156711499016117675_10162852526a2f5f23d44bd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甄敏芳 愛回家之三代同糖 （圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/6156711499016117675_10162852526a2f5f23d44bd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jenny.iannn）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:00:44.721411+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1363,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:54:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T13:58:31.069718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T13:58:31.069718+00:00","content_hash":"8e7f60c28dcdff5d2183c9026909edccdaa748e9a55ebb2e17df68da6705f675","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}